OL,3,GNEWSAStudent feared being 'killed'
OL,4,Abefore rape - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student feared she "would be killed"
OL,7,Fas she was led to the basement of a
OL,8,Fstranger's home before she was raped, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FThe woman, who cannot be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons, was attacked at an
OL,13,Faddress in the Hyde Park area of Leeds
OL,14,Fon 9 April this year, jurors at Leeds
OL,15,FCrown Court were told.
OL,17,FUvesh Vahora, 36, is standing trial for
OL,18,Fone charge of rape, which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
