OL,3,GNEWSAStudent feared being 'killed'
OL,4,Abefore rape - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Timothy Jacobs told the
OL,7,Fcourt the woman had earlier left her
OL,8,Fown house to buy food, but was
OL,9,Fapproached by the defendant, who then
OL,10,Ftook her to his own home and assaulted
OL,11,Fher.
